allenges and regain control.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            <div data-name=\"Card\" class=\"o_grid_item g-col-lg-4 g-height-10 col-lg-4\" style=\"z-index: 2; grid-area: 11 / 5 / 21 / 9;\">\n                    <div class=\"s_card card h-100 o_cc o_cc1 my-0 o_colored_level o_card_img_top\" data-vxml=\"001\" data-snippet=\"s_card\" data-name=\"Card\">\n                        <figure class=\"o_card_img_wrapper ratio ratio-16x9 mb-0\">\n                            <img src=\"/web/image/624-41667699/A_professional_office_setting_featuring_a_platinum.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"o_card_img img img-fluid o_we_custom_image card-img-top\" data-mimetype=\"image/webp\" data-original-id=\"623\" data-original-src=\"/web/image/623-6f2a8f2d/A_professional_office_setting_featuring_a_platinum.jpg\" data-mimetype-before-conversion=\"image/jpeg\" data-resize-width=\"690\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n                        </figure>\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>Tax Planning</h5><div class=\"s_hr pt8 pb16\" data-snippet=\"s_hr\" data-name=\"Separator\">\n        <hr class=\"w-100 mx-auto\"/>\n    </div><p class=\"card-text\">\n        Plan ahead and save more with our proactive tax planning solutions. We help you navigate complex regulations, minimize liabilities, and maximize savings, ensuring your business remains compliant and profitable year-round. <br/></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div data-name=\"Card\" class=\"o_grid_item g-col-lg-4 g-height-10 col-lg-4\" style=\"z-index: 1; grid-area: 1 / 5 / 11 / 9;\">\n                    <div class=\"s_card o_card_img_top card h-100 o_cc o_cc1 my-0 o_colored_level\" data-vxml=\"001\" data-snippet=\"s_card\" data-name=\"Card\">\n                        <figure class=\"o_card_img_wrapper ratio ratio-16x9 mb-0\">\n                            <img src=\"/web/image/627-c535a14b